The Volkswagen Golf GTI Clubsport 45 is a special edition of the Mk8 Golf GTI Clubsport, released in 2021 to celebrate the 45th anniversary of the GTI. It features specific styling elements and the removal of the speed limiter compared to the standard Clubsport.

Here is the evaluation based on the gathered data for the 2021 Volkswagen Golf GTI Clubsport 45:

